<title>USA: Alkermes in deal with Johnson and Johnson.</title>
<headline>Alkermes in deal with Johnson and Johnson.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alkermes Inc said Monday it has signed an agreement with a division of Johnson &amp; Johnson to deliver a proprietary compound with a single injection that would last for several weeks.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, Johnson &amp; Johnson's R.W. Johnson Pharmaceutical Research Institute will provide about $20 million in funding for the project.</p>
<p>Alkermes said it will use its ProLease system of delivering large molecules with the research institute's unnamed, proprietary compound being developed for the treatment of hormone mediated disorders.</p>
</text>
